1
00:00:00,067 --> 00:00:01,537
(Sheldon:)As soon as we get home,

2
00:00:01,536 --> 00:00:03,806
(Sheldon:)I want to have coitus with Amy.

3
00:00:11,179 --> 00:00:12,779
(Sheldon:)Okay, she can't hear.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,850
(Sheldon:)The reason I called you

5
00:00:17,852 --> 00:00:20,422
(Sheldon:)is because I didn't want Amy

6
00:00:20,421 --> 00:00:22,991
(Sheldon:)to know I couldn't make it
on my own.

7
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:25,090
(Leonard:)What's the big deal?

8
00:00:25,092 --> 00:00:27,492
(Sheldon:)Oh, of course it's
no big deal to you.

9
00:00:27,495 --> 00:00:29,965
(Sheldon:)You idolize me,
and nothing could ever knock me

10
00:00:29,964 --> 00:00:32,194
(Sheldon:)off that pedestal you put me on.

11
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,270
(Leonard:)Well, yeah, it's true.

12
00:00:34,268 --> 00:00:36,038
You-you are a god to me.

13
00:00:37,338 --> 00:00:38,938
(Amy:)Can I stop now?

14
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:41,640
(Leonard:)Just tell her.

15
00:00:42,844 --> 00:00:45,174
(Sheldon:)I called Leonard because...

16
00:00:45,179 --> 00:00:47,179
(Sheldon:)I failed.

17
00:00:47,181 --> 00:00:50,381
(Sheldon:)And I didn't want you
to think less of me.

18
00:00:51,319 --> 00:00:53,389
(Amy:)You were worried about that?

19
00:00:54,856 --> 00:00:59,026
(Sheldon:)Yes.

